ontrol çekirdeği" (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce134e85-45c2-54b4-a1bb-3e4a0d972b77"))(text "ESC-3K | 10_MCU | A2 | TASARIM INCELEMESI" (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f921adb-bc27-56f0-b452-14e4a4a93dfb"))(text "TASARIM NOTLARI / KABUL KRITERLERI" (at 300 37 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9af7cb2f-edce-5788-98e1-19d46043de59"))(text "1. TIM1: PA8/9/10 high; PB13/14/15 complementary low. PB12\ndonanım break girişi." (at 300 48 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "69a22bbd-624f-5e02-9d25-719c53896d91"))(text "2. Hall: PC6/7/8 (TIM3). RC: PA15 (TIM2). Bir zamanlayıcının\nperiyodu diğer girişle paylaşılmaz." (at 300 58.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5698b000-67f3-548e-8a80-c5545fb58414"))(text "3. SPI1: PB3/4/5. CAN: PA11/12. UART: PC10/11. SWD: PA13/14." (at 300 69.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98d25d36-3d62-58c1-868e-20375f319190"))(text "4. PG10 pin7 NRST olarak kalır. Option-byte değiştirilmeden\nreset davranışı korunur." (at 300 77.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "01df8cf9-2f55-54ad-bf9d-67797d58500d"))(text "5. PB8 BOOT0 pull-down. HSE bypass 8 MHz başlangıç seçimi.\nSaat ağacı CubeMX/derleme ile doğrulanacak." (at 300 88.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a7777bf3-670f-533f-a527-61b8574b4c4e"))(text "6. RET3 stok kaydı yalnız 4 adet gösterdi; seri üretim tedarik\nkapısı açık." (at 300 99.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cde7e503-bd0a-5c1d-8838-1e6587e795b9"))(polyline (pts (xy 292 35) (xy 292 256)) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (uuid "4faeecba-e7d8-50e8-9dcc-7ab89e3c7b71"))(symbol (lib_id "ESC_A2:MCU") (at 139.7 101.6 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "acc9143d-3b13-5d15-9253-5ab967be7cf0")(property "Reference" "U1701" (at 139.7 51.41999999999999